  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut brown onion and tomato into thick wedges. Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-e87a4a5e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a small bowl, combine creamy pesto dressing and the water (for the dressing). Set aside.\n• In a medium bowl, combine garlic & herb seasoning, lemon pepper seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, tossing to coat. Set aside. Little cooks: Take charge by combining the pesto and the water!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-3145caed.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water (for the couscous) and chicken-style stock powder, then bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir to combine, then cover with a lid. Remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-738c2f0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fluff up couscous with a fork.\n• Gently stir in roasted veggies. Cover to keep warm. Little cooks: Under adult supervision, help fluff up the couscous once the pan has cooled down. Be careful, it will still be hot!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-ba9826a5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-522d4b7a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with Mediterranean pork.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds. Drizzle with the creamy pesto to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touches by sprinkling the almonds and drizzling the pesto on top!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6297f3246fa2356962098b63/step-ac1e5d8c.jpg"
    }
  ]
